  "title": "Hearty Velvety Peruvian Seafood Anticuchos",
  "description": "A sweet and velvety Peruvian dish featuring seafood stock, served in a stone bowl and Whole30 friendly, perfect as a hangover cure.",
  "cuisine": "Peruvian",
